    "abstract": "Spatial transcriptomics preserves histological tissue coordinates while measuring gene expression profiles. We present an optimal transport alignment algorithm that maps cellular spatial coordinates across serial tissue sections, resolving ligand-receptor signaling pathways in tumor microenvironments.",
    "doi": "10.1038/s41592-022-01683-9",
